<attribute name="problem" nodeId="9a65cecd">&lt;p&gt;
    The Next Gen Testing Platform (NGTP) is a customizable platform designed to optimize Oracle Cloud testing and increase
    the return on investment for automation. It bridges business and technology teams, featuring pre-built automation, test
    design optimization, reusable Oracle Cloud test scripts, and test intelligence workbenches. NGTP can be used to test
    web and desktop applications, APIs and microservices, data and ETL functions, mainframes.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;img class=&quot;fitImage&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;./../../../process.adv.eya_oracle.base/guidances/practices/resources/nextgen.jpg&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Please contact &lt;a class=&quot;urlFileLink&quot; href=&quot;mailto:Neelima.Raghu@ey.com&quot;&gt;Neelima Raghu&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&quot;urlFileLink&quot;
    href=&quot;mailto:Rainer.Hahn@ey.com&quot;&gt;Rainer Hahn&lt;/a&gt; for more information and access to this tool.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
